  "pli-tv-bi-vb-pc51:4.3.4": "Sp 2.1027: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Sīsānulokikāti paṭhamaṁ pavisantīnaṁ bhikkhunīnaṁ sīsaṁ anulokentī pavisati, anāpatti</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Sīsānulokika</i> means there is no offense if she enters while looking at the head of the nuns entering first.” The point, perhaps, is that she may assume that the nun in front has asked for permission. ",
